q(6,9,'RC charging','An initially uncharged capacitor is connected to 12 V through R=1 kΩ, with C=1000 µF. Find capacitor voltage after 1 s.',12*(1-Math.exp(-1)),'V','This is one RC time constant, so the final voltage is not yet reached.', ['τ = RC = 1 s','Uc = 12(1−e⁻¹)'],S('book-c6-p82-r08',{U:12,t:1,R:1000,C:.001}));
